        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>8 Inch Center to Center Ladder Style Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12\" Contemporary Ladder Pull is great for glass doors such as shower doors. It is available in polished chrome, brushed nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes to fit any decor; but it is the sharp, clean lines of this handle that give it a modern feel. It has a 8\" center to center mounting. This glass door handle is made out of 3/4\" diameter round tubing. For glass 5/16\" to 1/2\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-5-2-update-finish.jpg?v=1704442282\" width=\"220\" height=\"455\" border=\"0\" alt=\"SDH-208H 8 Inch Center to Center Ladder Pull  Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/10-inch-contemporary-shower-pulls-pair-sdh-206h\"><b>10 Inch Glass Door Ladder Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Contemporary Ladder Style Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12\" (305 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Length: 8\" center to center (203 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 3/4\" (19 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li>Inner Contact Tubing: 5/6\" (16 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hole in Glass Diameter: 3/8\" Minimum</li>\r\n<li>For 5/16\" (8 mm) to 1/2\" (12 mm) thick glass</li>\r\n<li>Back-to-back mounting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a pair (2 pulls) for Glass Door</i>\r\n</p>",
